-- T0+T1+T2=0, then the weighted sum reduces to only two weight defects.  Thus
-- failed cyclic descent is potentially the desired multiplier-difference gain,
-- not merely an obstruction.
--
-- The remaining same-object wall is explicit: R230's fixed-output mixed-
-- helicity product-rule forcing is not yet identified with the conserved three-
-- leg modal-transfer triple.  The cyclic route is therefore optional and
-- fail-closed until that weld (or its exact mismatch) is proved.
